<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <p>Hi {{ .fullName }},</p>

    <p>
      Your application to join the Cloudadore community has been approved.
      Follow the link below to choose a password and activate your account.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="{{ .invitationLink }}"
         style="display: inline-block; background: #08568A; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">
        Accept your invitation
      </a>
    </p>

    <p style="color: #555; font-size: 14px;">
      This link can be used once and expires on {{ .expiresAt }}. If it has
      expired, apply again and we will send a fresh invitation.
    </p>

    <p style="color: #555; font-size: 14px;">
      If you did not apply to join Cloudadore, you can ignore this email — no
      account has been created, and none will be unless this link is used.
    </p>

    <p>— The Cloudadore team</p>
  </body>
</html>
